 ],
 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Theo had a shadow",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.129,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "again.",
   "start": 2.129,
   "end": 2.775,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "But it wasn't his.",
   "start": 3.275,
   "end": 5.045,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "It followed him everywhere.",
   "start": 6.145,
   "end": 8.204,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Always\u2026 one second too",
   "start": 8.204,
   "end": 9.881,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "late.",
   "start": 9.881,
   "end": 10.263,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And at night\u2026 it",
   "start": 10.763,
   "end": 12.115,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "whispered.",
   "start": 12.115,
   "end": 12.96,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Your shadow works for",
   "start": 13.46,
   "end": 15.02,
   "spk": "F"
  },
  {
   "text": "me now. Forever.",
   "start": 15.02,
   "end": 16.208,
   "spk": "F"
  },
  {
   "text": "And tonight at nine,",
   "start": 18.145,
   "end": 19.663,
   "spk": "F"
  },
  {
   "text": "I clock out\u2026",
   "start": 19.663,
   "end": 20.574,
   "spk": "F"
  },
  {
   "text": "and this time, I'm",
   "start": 20.874,
   "end": 22.08,
   "spk": "F"
  },
  {
   "text": "taking you with me.",
   "start": 22.08,
   "end": 23.352,
   "spk": "F"
  },
  {
   "text": "Mom, please. You saw",
   "start": 26.145,
   "end": 27.363,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "the black sun.",
   "start": 27.363,
   "end": 28.215,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "I believe you. What",
   "start": 28.815,
   "end": 30.06,
   "spk": "MO"
  },
  {
   "text": "do we do?",
   "start": 30.06,
   "end": 30.649,
   "spk": "MO"
  },
  {
   "text": "The factory has a",
   "start": 31.049,
   "end": 32.095,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "time clock. Every shadow",
   "start": 32.095,
   "end": 33.572,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "has a card.",
   "start": 33.572,
   "end": 34.249,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "If I punch my",
   "start": 34.549,
   "end": 35.404,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "card\u2026 my shadow has",
   "start": 35.404,
   "end": 36.652,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "to come back to",
   "start": 36.652,
   "end": 37.638,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "me.",
   "start": 37.638,
   "end": 37.835,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "At nine o'clock, they",
   "start": 40.145,
   "end": 41.674,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "slipped into the factory.",
   "start": 41.674,
   "end": 43.495,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And behind the time",
   "start": 43.995,
   "end": 45.539,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "clock\u2026 was a door.",
   "start": 45.539,
   "end": 47.003,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Inside, hundreds of shadows",
   "start": 49.145,
   "end": 51.289,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "hung from hooks. Like",
   "start": 51.289,
   "end": 52.957,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "coats.",
   "start": 52.957,
   "end": 53.433,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "There! That's mine!",
   "start": 54.033,
   "end": 55.399,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "But the shadow under",
   "start": 59.145,
   "end": 60.7,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Theo's feet\u2026 stood up.",
   "start": 60.7,
   "end": 62.409,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody leaves the night",
   "start": 62.809,
   "end": 64.405,
   "spk": "F"
  },
  {
   "text": "shift.",
   "start": 64.405,
   "end": 64.821,
   "spk": "F"
  },
  {
   "text": "Let go of my",
   "start": 68.145,
   "end": 69.057,
   "spk": "MO"
  },
  {
   "text": "son!",
   "start": 69.057,
   "end": 69.361,
   "spk": "MO"
  },
  {
   "text": "Shadows hate one thing.",
   "start": 69.761,
   "end": 71.506,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Light\u2026 from the front.",
   "start": 71.506,
   "end": 73.175,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Theo grabbed his card\u2026",
   "start": 76.145,
   "end": 77.934,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "and punched it.",
   "start": 77.934,
   "end": 79.153,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "His shadow woke up.",
   "start": 82.145,
   "end": 83.868,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And ran home.",
   "start": 83.868,
   "end": 85.047,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "You're back. For real",
   "start": 85.647,
   "end": 86.947,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "this time.",
   "start": 86.947,
   "end": 87.567,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "And his shadow waved.",
   "start": 87.967,
   "end": 89.695,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "But on the last",
   "start": 93.145,
   "end": 94.316,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "hook\u2026 hung one more",
   "start": 94.316,
   "end": 95.799,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "shadow.",
   "start": 95.799,
   "end": 96.345,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Its name tag said\u2026",
   "start": 96.645,
   "end": 98.749,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Mara.",
   "start": 98.749,
   "end": 99.333,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Mom\u2026 that's your name.",
   "start": 99.733,
   "end": 101.184,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then whose shadow\u2026 is",
   "start": 101.784,
   "end": 103.55,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "following you?",
   "start": 103.55,
   "end": 104.728,
   "spk": "N"
  }
 ],
